    "5 rows": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 行"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A matte, woven page set in New York: ruled sections, small capitals, meters as scales.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New York で組んだ、織り目のあるマットな紙面：罫線で区切る欄、スモールキャップス、目盛りのメーター。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以 New York 排版的哑光织纹纸面：细线分隔的栏目、小型大写标题、刻度式仪表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A node that isn't in the topology shows as such.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "トポロジーにないノードは、その旨が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不在拓扑中的节点会如实标明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A northern sky at night: teal deepening to violet, round shapes, meters of dots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夜の北の空：深まる青緑から紫へ、丸い形とドットのメーター。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "北方夜空：青绿渐入紫色，圆润的形状与点阵仪表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place takes the zone its name suggests. Choose another when that’s wrong, or None to leave its servers out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "場所には名前から推定したタイムゾーンが使われます。違う場合は別のゾーンを、そのサーバーを外すには「なし」を選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地点使用其名称所对应的时区。若不正确，请选择其他时区；选择“无”可将其服务器排除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
